  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>101</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>101</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>101</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now checking periodicity of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> periodic with period 2</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>52</mn></math></p><p>Now checking periodicity of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has periodicity of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>104</mn><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>104</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>52</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>52</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>101</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>52</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
